  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* task 4 *)\r\n\r\nNSolve[x^7 + 7 x == 7 , x]\r\n\r\nNSolve[Cos(x) == x , x]\r\n\r\nPlot[{Exp[x], x^2}, {x, -1, 1}]\r\nFindRoot[Exp[x] - x^2 == 0, {x, -0.7}]\r\n\r\nPlot[Sinh[x] - 1 - 1/x, {x, -2, -0.5}]\r\nPlot[Sinh[x] - 1 - 1/x, {x, 0.5, 2}]\r\nFindRoot[Sinh[x] - 1 - 1/x == 0, {x, -0.6}]\r\nFindRoot[Sinh[x] - 1 - 1/x == 0, {x, 1.25}]\r\n\r\nPlot[Sin[x] + x/2 - 1, {x, -4Pi, 4Pi}]\r\nFindRoot[Sin[x] + x/2 - 1 == 0, {x, 0.7}]\r\n\r\nPlot[Exp[x] - x - 1, {x, -0.3, 0.3}]\r\nFindRoot[Exp[x] - x - 1 == 0, {x, 0}]\r\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
